 ## Operating characteristics
--   **Time Complexity:** Build time is $O(N^3)$ for the fine grid, but the macrocell build is $O((N/M)^3)$ which is trivial [S2, S3]. Traversal time is reduced by skipping empty macrocells. The overhead of checking macrocells is minimal [S2, S3].
--   **Memory Complexity:** Adds $O((N/M)^3)$ bits (or bytes) for the macrocell grid. For $M=6$, this is roughly $1/216$ of the fine grid size, which is negligible [G].
